10. Liver and kidney functions need to meet the following criteria:

1. Total bilirubin (conjugated + unconjugated) ≤ 2.5 × upper limit of normal (ULN) corresponding to age, patients with confirmed Gilbert's syndrome may be enrolled based on the investigator's discretion;
